WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.183
Today we will shape a useful object from malleable material. Our work connects with

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:06.963
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:10.066
Roll a smooth ball of soft material.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:17.063
Press a thumb gently into the centre and pinch the sides evenly. Record why your

00:00:17.063 --> 00:00:18.823
chosen technique suits the message.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.559
Smooth the rim and show how the finished bowl can stand.
